{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", "domain": "relationship", "question": "在2022壬寅年，以下哪项是命主的婚姻经历？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于申月，金旺土虚，身弱喜火土。命局中月柱甲木正官透干，日支巳火为印星，但被申金合绊，官星与印星均有受损之象，暗示婚姻宫不稳，配偶宫有暗动。\n\n2022年壬寅，流年天干壬水为正财，与日主己土相合（己壬合），财星合身，主感情、婚姻之事。地支寅木为官星，与命局中申金形成寅申冲，且寅巳申三刑俱全，刑冲并见，主婚姻宫和配偶宫剧烈动荡。天干己克壬，为日主主动克制财星，暗示命主在感情中主动出击或掌控局面。\n\n结合大运，命主在2022年正行庚辰大运（35-44岁），庚金伤官透干，伤官克官，本就对婚姻不利，易有口舌是非或感情波折。流年寅木官星被申金冲克，且三刑入命，官星受损严重，代表丈夫或婚姻关系受到严重冲击。\n\n综合判断，命主自身在婚姻中处于主动地位，且伤官运中易有外遇倾向（伤官生财，财为欲望），流年财星合身，更易引发婚外情。寅申冲、寅巳申刑，主冲突激烈，难以调和，且官星被冲克严重，得不到原谅的可能性大，当年离婚概率高。\n\n因此，最符合的选项为B。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "4ff52ed3b21199cf678546fc773e3033b509c7ff6b757789a0e8de75ce2fb0f4", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5401, "response_id": "1376093c-9082-4a3d-b7ba-1969750db71e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 534, "completion_tokens": 353, "total_tokens": 887, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 534}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "d