{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q11", "domain": "unknown", "question": "大约哪个时间段，运程最佳？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为丁火，生于寒冬子月，地支丑、酉、子、丑，金水旺盛，火气衰弱，日主身弱无疑。命局喜木火为用神，忌金水。\n\n大运排布中：\n- 23—32岁对应丁酉大运（1988-1997），丁火比肩帮身，但酉金为忌，且与原局酉金伏吟，金旺克木，火势仍弱，运程平平。\n- 33—42岁对应丙申大运（1998-2007），丙火劫财帮身，但申金合子水，水势更旺，忌神猖獗，运程不佳。\n- 43—52岁对应乙未大运（2008-2017），乙木偏印生火，未土为燥土，且未中藏丁火，木火相生，用神得力，此运明显转好。\n- 53—62岁对应甲午大运（2018-2027），甲木正印生火，午火为日主强根，木火通明，用神到位，是命主一生中最旺的运程。\n\n综合比较，53—62岁甲午大运，干支皆为喜用，且午火为丁火禄地，力量最强，故运程最佳。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q11", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3869, "response_id": "5a5949d5-b594-40ef-af16-9830d3c13eea", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 408, "completion_tokens": 302, "total_tokens": 710, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 408}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
