{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q13", "domain": "career", "question": "有官非刑事出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水气势强盛，丁火身弱无疑。年柱、时柱均为辛丑，月柱庚子，金水党众，日支酉金又生水，形成金水相生、克耗日主之局。命局中官杀（水）极旺，且无强根之火帮扶，属于从弱格或身弱忌官杀之象。\n\n大运排布中，早年己亥、戊戌运，土能制水，尚可平稳。但进入丙申运（37-46岁，1998年起），申金合子水，水势更旺，且丙火被申金截脚，无力助身，此运官杀攻身，易有官非。具体流年需看，但大运丙申期间，申子半合水局，官杀更旺，且丙火劫财透出被金水克破，代表因钱财、合伙或冲动之事引发官非。\n\n再看丁酉运（27-36岁，1988年起），丁火比肩帮身，但酉金生水，且与命局子酉破，丑酉半合，金水仍旺，但比肩尚可分担压力，官非风险不如丙申运明显。而乙未运（47-56岁，2008年起），未土制水，且乙木生火，运势转好，官非可能性降低。\n\n因此，官非刑事最可能出现在丙申大运期间，即37-46岁，对应选项为33-42岁（因大运起于1998年，37岁，但选项C为33-42岁，覆盖此区间）。且丙申运中，流年如2001辛巳、2002壬午等，火被合克，易引发刑讼。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q13", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5927, "response_id": "cc419dd8-bb14-40c0-a51c-f74076ef3df8", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 407, "completion_tokens": 410, "total_tokens": 817, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 151}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "