{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q14", "domain": "unknown", "question": "有凶劫之灾出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字（辛丑、庚子、丁酉、辛丑），日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水过重，丁火无根，属于身弱极需帮扶之命。早年大运己亥、戊戌，皆为土运，土虽能晦火，但也能制水，尚可维持。但流年若遇强金水或木火失衡，则易有灾。\n\n分析各选项流年：\n- 1965年乙巳：乙木生丁火，巳火为丁火之根，且巳酉丑三合金局，但巳火为用神，虽有合化金之象，但火根仍在，且乙木生火，凶性不显。\n- 1968年戊申：戊土伤官透出，申金为财，申子辰三合水局（子水在月支，申子半合水），水势大增，克身更重，且戊土泄火生金，加重财官之势，此年水旺火熄，为凶险之象。\n- 1971年辛亥：辛金偏财透，亥水正官，亥子丑会水局（月支子、时支丑），水势极旺，丁火被重重克泄，但亥中甲木藏而不透，救应无力，亦凶，但比1968年稍缓。\n- 1974年甲寅：甲木正印透出，寅木为火之长生，木火相生，为喜用神到位，是吉年。\n\n综合比较，1968年戊申，申子半合水局，水势最旺，且戊土伤官泄身生财，财再生官杀，克身最重，凶灾最明显。因此凶劫之灾应在1968年。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "6fbdcedb130f902d280faa5ed3bd785b4042c3080e46ea9c87e9c8395734596e", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q14", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5347, "response_id": "47bffe71-dde7-4786-89d9-1c2770251266", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 530, "completion_tokens": 403, "total_tokens": 933, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 274}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
